tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-2256-a-group-naming-the-runtimes-own-header-is-refused.hero:15:8: error[ffi_runtime_header]: `heroes_runtime.h` is the Heroes runtime's own header, the interface the C this compiler writes calls, and no program binds it: its functions count the references of the program's own values and free them, so one called from Heroes frees what the program still holds
